Capability sentinel for the pro-maint-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/pro-maint
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises the Atlas Pro directory-maintenance
verbs Ptah implements as open capabilities (`atlas migrate edit`, `atlas
migrate rebase`, and `atlas migrate rm`, stokaro/ptah#807) fully offline: a
hermetic scripted $EDITOR edits a migration, a migration is rebased to the
end of history, and a migration is removed — each verb rewriting atlas.sum
so `ptah migrations validate` stays green. Atlas keeps these verbs in its
proprietary Pro build — the pinned CE binary aborts on them — so these
fixtures are intentionally separate from the Atlas schema round-trip corpus
(stokaro/ptah#758).
